#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:2
msgid "How to enable offline formats"
msgstr "如何启用离线格式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:4
msgid ""
"This guide provides **step-by-step instructions to enabling offline "
"formats** of your documentation."
msgstr "本指南提供**启用文档离线格式的分步说明** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:6
msgid ""
"They are automatically built by Read the Docs during our default build "
"process, as long as you have the configuration enabled to turn this on."
msgstr "只要配置中启用了该功能，Read the Docs 会在默认构建过程中自动构建它们。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:10
msgid "Enabling offline formats"
msgstr "启用离线格式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:12
msgid ""
"Offline formats are enabled by the :ref:`config-file/v2:formats` key in our "
"config file. A simple example is here:"
msgstr "通过配置文件中的 :ref:`config-file/v2:formats` 键启用离线格式。简单示例如下："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:23
msgid "Verifying offline formats"
msgstr "验证离线格式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:25
msgid ""
"You can verify that offline formats are building in your :guilabel:`Project "
"dashboard` > :guilabel:`Downloads`:"
msgstr "你可以在 :guilabel:`Project dashboard` > :guilabel:`Downloads` 中验证离线格式是否已构建："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:31
msgid "Deleting offline formats"
msgstr "删除离线格式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:33
msgid ""
"The entries in the Downloads section of your project dashboard reflect the "
"formats specified in your config file for each active version."
msgstr "项目仪表板 Downloads 区域中的条目，反映配置文件中为每个活跃版本指定的格式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:36
msgid ""
"This means that if you wish to remove downloadable content for a given "
"version, you can do so by removing the matching :ref:`config-"
"file/v2:formats` key from your config file."
msgstr "这意味着若要移除某个版本的可下载内容，只需从配置文件中删除对应的 :ref:`config-file/v2:formats` 键。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:42
msgid "Continue learning"
msgstr "继续学习"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:46
msgid ""
"Other pages in our documentation are relevant to this feature, and might be "
"a useful next step."
msgstr "我们文档中的其他页面与此功能相关，可作为下一步参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:50
msgid ":doc:`/offline-formats` - Overview of this feature."
msgstr ":doc:`/offline-formats` - 此功能概览。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:51
msgid ""
":ref:`config-file/v2:formats` - Configuration file options for offline "
"formats."
msgstr ":ref:`config-file/v2:formats` - 离线格式的配置文件选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/enable-offline-formats.rst:52
msgid ""
":ref:`build-customization:where to put files` - Where to put offline format "
"output when using custom build commands."
msgstr ":ref:`build-customization:where to put files` - 使用自定义构建命令时离线格式输出的放置位置。"

